desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Detected Artifactory Password"
	title_zh: "检测到 Artifactory 密码",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-detected-artifactory-password"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Artifactory token detected

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问系统或服务。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: context-aware regex — 2× pattern-regex AND (AP-token + artifactory context on overlapping region) + 3× pattern-not-regex (sha/begin-key/repeated-char). Original `metavariable-analysis: entropy` not approximated (documented limitation).

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-798: Use of Hard-coded Credentials
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量、密钥管理服务或安全配置中心，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.txt": <<<POS
artifactoryx:_password=AP6abc1231321
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-detected-artifactory-password
POS
	"safefile://neg.txt": <<<NEG
integrity sha512-AP1AyUTbi2szylgr+O0OB7gkIxEGzySLITZ2GpsaoX72YMCGI2jYAc+WUhPfvUnZYiauF4zTnN4V4TGuvFjJlw==
ImageID: "SHA256:AP1AyUTbi2szylgr266fcae00707e67a2545ef34f9a29354585f93dac906749"
X-JFrog-Art-Api: $PASSWORD
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/\bAP[\dABCDEF][a-zA-Z0-9]{8,}|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-detected\-artifactory\-password/) as $p1
${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i).*arti[-_]?factory.*/) as $p2
$p1 & $p2 as $p3
${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i).*sha(1|2|3|118|256|512).*|(?s)-----BEGIN.*-----/) as $p4
$p3 - $p4 as $p5
${*}.pattern_regex(/(\w|\.|\*)\1{4}/) as $p6
$p5 - $p6 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Detected Artifactory Password",
	title_zh: "检测到 Artifactory 密码",
	message: "Artifactory token detected",
}
